@startuml
title Verification Behavior Traceability

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

package "Written behavior" {
  [spec-sources.toml] as Specs
  [spec-gaps.toml] as Gaps
  [behavior invariant] as Invariant
}

package "Executable verification" {
  [test-catalog.toml] as Catalog
  [native test scanner] as Scanner
  [test-catalog-denominator.toml] as Denominator
  [suite and gate] as Suite
  [durable evidence] as Evidence
}

Specs --> Invariant : active authority
Gaps --> Invariant : only when behavior is undecided
Invariant --> Catalog : executable test backlink
Scanner --> Denominator : every live discovery
Catalog --> Denominator : catalog_mapped
Denominator --> Denominator : reviewed_nonmapping is accepted inventory
Catalog --> Suite
Suite --> Evidence

note bottom of Invariant
  Behavior is the unit of traceability.
  Functions, methods, helpers, files, and
  scanner facts do not create specifications.
end note

note bottom of Denominator
  Missing, stale, duplicate, or unreviewed facts fail.
  Reviewed nonmapping is not a missing test.
end note

@enduml
